# {{lb|en|American football|Gaelic football|hurling}} Any of the defensive [[players]] who are in [[position]] on each side farthest laterally from the ball and whose principal responsibility is to [[defend]] [[against]] passes.
#: {{ux|en|The '''cornerback''' tipped the ball away from the receiver.}}

